  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat your oven to 200°C (400°F).",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, cheese, eggs, baking powder, and salt.",
    "3. Stir in the chopped parsley and melted butter.",
    "4. Heat a large non-stick frying pan over medium heat.",
    "5. Using a 1/4 cup measuring cup, scoop the batter into the pan.",
    "6. Flatten the batter slightly with a spatula.",
    "7. Cook for 2-3 minutes, until golden brown.",
    "8. Flip the fritters over and cook for a further 2 minutes.",
    "9. Serve warm and enjoy!"
